/strong>,<em> 72</em>, 108338. https://doi.org/10.1016/j.est.2023.108338.</p></div></li><li class="flex space-x-2.5 w-full"><span>92.</span><div class="text-left article-paragraph pr-2"><p>Bragaglia, M.; Lamastra, F.R.; Berrocal, J.A.; et al. Sustainable Phase Change Materials (PCMs): Waste Fat from Cooking Pork Meat Confined in Polypropylene Fibrous Mat from Waste Surgical Mask and Porous Bio‑Silica.<em> Mater. Today Sustain. </em><strong>2023</strong>,<em> 23</em>, 100454. https://doi.org/10.1016/j.mtsust.2023.100454.</p></div></li><li class="flex space-x-2.5 w-full"><span>93.</span><div class="text-left article-paragraph pr-2"><p>Jin, C.; Sun, S.; Yang, D.; et al. Anaerobic Digestion: An Alternative Resource Treatment Option for Food Waste in China.<em> Sci. Total Environ. </em><strong>2021</strong>,<em> 779</em>, 146397. https://doi.org/10.1016/j.scitotenv.2021.146397.</p></div></li><li class="flex space-x-2.5 w-full"><span>94.</span><div class="text-left article-paragraph pr-2"><p>Liu, H.; Qian, Z.; Wang, Q.; et al. Development of Renewable Biomass‑Derived Carbonaceous Aerogel/Mannitol Phase‑Change Composites for High Thermal-Energy-Release Efficiency and Shape Stabilization.<em> ACS Appl. Energy Mater. </em><strong>2021</strong>,<em> 4</em>, 1714–1730. https://doi.org/10.1021/acsaem.0c02864.</p></div></li><li class="flex space-x-2.5 w-full"><span>95.</span><div class="text-left article-paragraph pr-2"><p>Li, S.; Li, J.; Geng, Y.; et al. Shape-Stable Phase Change Composites Based on Carbonized Waste Pomelo Peel for Low-Grade Thermal Energy Storage.<em> J. Energy Storage </em><strong>2022</strong>,<em> 47</em>, 103556. https://doi.org/10.1016/j.est.2021.103556.</p></div></li><li class="flex space-x-2.5 w-full"><span>96.</span><div class="text-left article-paragraph pr-2"><p>Luo, Y.; Zhang, F.; Li, C.; et al. Biomass-Based Shape-Stable Phase Change Materials Supported by Garlic Peel-Derived Porous Carbon for Thermal Energy Storage.<em> J. Energy Storage </em><strong>2022</strong>,<em> 46</em>, 103929. https://doi.org/10.1016/j.est.2021.103929.</p></div></li><li class="flex space-x-2.5 w-full"><span>97.</span><div class="text-left article-paragraph pr-2"><p>Xiong, T.; Ok, Y.S.; Dissanayake, P.D.; et al. Preparation and Thermal Conductivity Enhancement of a Paraffin Wax‑Based Composite Phase Change Material Doped with Garlic Stem Biochar Microparticles.<em> Sci. Total Environ. </em><strong>2022</strong>,<em> 827</em>, 154341. https://doi.org/10.1016/j.scitotenv.2022.154341.</p></div></li><li class="flex space-x-2.5 w-full"><span>98.</span><div class="text-left article-paragraph pr-2"><p>Yu, K.; Liu, Y.; Jia, M.; et al. Bio-Based Dual‑Functionalized Phase Change Composite: Ultrafast Solar-to-Thermal Conversion and Reinforced Heat Storage Capacity.<em> Energy Fuels </em><strong>2021</strong>,<em> 35</em>, 16162–16173. https://doi.org/10.1021/acs.energyfuels.1c02203.</p></div></li><li class="flex space-x-2.5 w-full"><span>99.</span><div class="text-left article-paragraph pr-2"><p>Gu, X.; Liu, P.; Peng, L.; et al. Low Cost, Eco-Friendly, Modified Fly Ash‑Based Shape‑Stabilized Phase Change Material with Enhanced Thermal Storage Capacity and Heat Transfer Efficiency for Thermal Energy Storage. <em>Sol. Energy Mater. Sol. Cells</em> <strong>2021</strong>,<em> 232</em>, 111343. https://doi.org/10.1016/j.solmat.2021.111343.</p></div></li><li class="flex space-x-2.5 w-full"><span>100.</span><div class="text-left article-paragraph pr-2"><p>Beghetto, V. Strategies for the Transformation of Waste Cooking Oils into High-Value Products: A Critical Review.<em> Polymers </em><strong>2025</strong>,<em> 17</em>, 368. https://doi.org/10.3390/polym17030368.</p></div></li><li class="flex space-x-2.5 w-full"><span>101.</span><div class="text-left article-paragraph pr-2"><p>Zadshir, M.; Kim, B.W.; Yin, H. Bio-Based Phase Change Materials for Sustainable Development.<em> Materials </em><strong>2024</strong>,<em> 17</em>, 4816. https://doi.org/10.3390/ma17194816.</p></div></li><li class="flex space-x-2.5 w-full"><span>102.</span><div class="text-left article-paragraph pr-2"><p>Mannu, A.; Garroni, S.; Ibanez Porras, J.; et al. Available Technologies and Materials for Waste Cooking Oil Recycling.<em> Processes </em><strong>2020</strong>,<em> 8</em>, 366. https://doi.org/10.3390/pr8030366.</p></div></li><li class="flex space-x-2.5 w-full"><span>103.</span><div class="text-left article-paragraph pr-2"><p>Okogeri, O.; Stathopoulos, V.N. What about Greener Phase Change Materials? A Review on Biobased Phase Change Materials for Thermal Energy Storage Applications.<em> Int. J. Thermofluids </em><strong>2021</strong>,<em> 10</em>, 100081. https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ijft.2021.100081.</p></div></li><li class="flex space-x-2.5 w-full"><span>104.</span><div class="text-left article-paragraph pr-2"><p>Oldham, D.; Rajib, A.; Dandamudi, K.P.R.; et al. Transesterification of Waste Cooking Oil to Produce a Sustainable Rejuvenator for Aged Asphalt.<em> Resour. Conserv. Recycl. </em><strong>2021</strong>,<em> 168</em>, 105297. https://doi.org/10.1016/j.resconrec.2020.105297.</p></div></li><li class="flex space-x-2.5 w-full"><span>105.</span><div class="text-left article-paragraph pr-2"><p>Larsen, J.A.; Stockman, J.; Li, X.; et al. Fatty Acid Analysis and Stability of Selected Edible Oils Used in Homemade Pet Diets.<em> J. Vet. Intern. Med. </em><strong>2025</strong>,<em> 39</em>, e70119. https://doi.org/10.1111/jvim.70119.</p></div></li><li class="flex space-x-2.5 w-full"><span>106.</span><div class="text-left article-paragraph pr-2"><p>Nešić, A.; Gordić, M.; Davidović, S.; et al. Pectin-Based Nanocomposite Aerogels for Potential Insulated Food Packaging Application.<em> Carbohydr. Polym. </em><strong>2018</strong>,<em> 195</em>, 128–135. https://doi.org/10.1016/j.carbpol.2018.04.076.</p></div></li><li class="flex space-x-2.5 w-full"><span>107.</span><div class="text-left article-paragraph pr-2"><p>Ben Aribia, W.; Trigui, A.; Alshammari, N.K.; et al. Development of Phase Change Eco‑Composite Materials from Eggshell Waste.<em> Green Chem. Lett. Rev. </em><strong>2024</strong>,<em> 17</em>, 2380060. https://doi.org/10.1080/17518253.2024.2380060.</p></div></li><li class="flex space-x-2.5 w-full"><span>108.</span><div class="text-left article-paragraph pr-2"><p>Kouchachvili, L.; Gagnon-Caya, G.; Djebbar, R. Wood-Derived Biochar as a Matrix for Cost‑Effective and High‑Performing Composite Thermal Energy Storage Materials.<em> J. Porous Mater. </em><strong>2025</strong>,<em> 32</em>, 55–66. https://doi.org/10.1007/s10934-024-01638-0.</p></div></li><li class="flex space-x-2.5 w-full"><span>109.</span><div class="text-left article-paragraph pr-2"><p>Silos, P.D.; Ocampo, A.A.; Remarim, A.M.E. Thermal Energy Storage Using Phase Change Material Derived from Waste Cooking Oil: A Case Study.<em> Int. J. Technol. Eng. Stud. </em><strong>2019</strong>,<em> 5</em>, 129–138. https://doi.org/10.20469/ijtes.5.10004-4.</p></div></li><li class="flex space-x-2.5 w-full"><span>110.</span><div class="text-left article-paragraph pr-2"><p>Zhao, Y.; Chen, M.; Wu, S.; et al. Preparation and Characterization of Phase Change Capsules Containing Waste Cooking Oil for Asphalt Binder Thermoregulation.<em> Constr. Build. Mater. </em><strong>2023</strong>,<em> 395</em>, 132311. https://doi.org/10.1016/j.conbuildmat.2023.132311.</p></div></li><li class="flex space-x-2.5 w-full"><span>111.</span><div class="text-left article-paragraph pr-2"><p>Yunlong, Z.; Meizhu, C.; Yuechao, Z.; et al. Microencapsulated Waste Cooking Oil Derivatives for Building Thermoregulation.<em> Constr. Build. Mater. </em><strong>2023</strong>,<em> 400</em>, 132644. https://doi.org/10.1016/j.conbuildmat.2023.132644.</p></div></li><li class="flex space-x-2.5 w-full"><span>112.</span><div class="text-left article-paragraph pr-2"><p>Kahwaji, S.; White, M.A. Edible Oils as Practical Phase Change Materials for Thermal Energy Storage.<em> Appl. Sci. </em><strong>2019</strong>,<em> 9</em>, 1627. https://doi.org/10.3390/app9081627.</p></div></li><li class="flex space-x-2.5 w-full"><span>113.</span><div class="text-left article-paragraph pr-2"><p>Zhao, Y.; Chen, M.; Wu, S.; et al. Recycling of Waste Edible Oil Derivatives as Phase Change Materials for Building Energy Conservation.<em> J. Clean. Prod. </em><strong>2024</strong>,<em> 472</em>, 143451. https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jclepro.2024.143451.</p></div></li><li class="flex space-x-2.5 w-full"><span>114.</span><div class="text-left article-paragraph pr-2"><p>United Nations Environment Programme (UNEP).<em> Global Waste Management Outlook 2024: Beyond an Age of Waste—Turning Rubbish into a Resource</em>; UNEP: Nairobi, Kenya, 2024. https://doi.org/10.59117/20.500.11822/44939.</p></div></li><li class="flex space-x-2.5 w-full"><span>115.</span><div class="text-left article-paragraph pr-2"><p>Trivedi, J.K.; Moutushi, T.; Burra, K.R.G.; et al. Impact of Gypsum Waste on MSW and WTE Ash for Material Recovery and Syngas Enhancement.<em> Waste Manag. </em><strong>2025</strong>,<em> 203</em>, 114859. https://doi.org/10.1016/j.wasman.2025.114859.</p></div></li><li class="flex space-x-2.5 w-full"><span>116.</span><div class="text-left article-paragraph pr-2"><p>Xiong, Y.; Song, C.; Ren, J.; et al. Sludge‑Incinerated Ash-Based Shape-Stable Phase Change Composites for Heavy Metal Fixation and Building Thermal Energy Storage.<em> Process Saf. Environ. Prot. </em><strong>2022</strong>,<em> 162</em>, 346–356. https://doi.org/10.1016/j.psep.2022.04.004.</p></div></li><li class="flex space-x-2.5 w-full"><span>117.</span><div class="text-left article-paragraph pr-2"><p>Xiong, Y.; He, M.; Zhang, A.; et al. Municipal Sludge-Based Low-Carbon Phase-Change Composite towards Energy Storage: Fabrication and Investigation.<em> Appl. Therm. Eng. </em><strong>2024</strong>,<em> 256</em>, 124073. https://doi.org/10.1016/j.applthermaleng.2024.124073.</p></div></li><li class="flex space-x-2.5 w-full"><span>118.</span><div class="text-left article-paragraph pr-2"><p>Dai, L.; Karakas, O.; Cheng, Y.; et al. A Review on Carbon Materials Production from Plastic Wastes.<em> Chem. Eng. J. </em><strong>2023</strong>,<em> 453</em>, 139725. https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cej.2022.139725.</p></div></li><li class="flex space-x-2.5 w-full"><span>119.</span><div class="text-left article-paragraph pr-2"><p>Shi, X.; Zhu, J.; Chen, B.; et al. Dissecting the Chemical Strain in Inactive Components of Sodium‑Ion Battery Cathodes.<em> Scr. Mater. </em><strong>2025</strong>,<em> 268</em>, 116880. https://doi.org/10.1016/j.scriptamat.2025.116880.</p></div></li><li class="flex space-x-2.5 w-full"><span>120.</span><div class="text-left article-paragraph pr-2"><p>Tewari, C.; Pathak, M.; Tatrari, G.; et al. Waste Plastics Derived Reduced Graphene Oxide‑Based Nanocomposite with Fe<sub>3</sub>O<sub>4</sub> for Water Purification and Supercapacitor Applications.<em> J. Ind. Eng. Chem. </em><strong>2024</strong>,<em> 130</em>, 346–356. https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jiec.2023.09.038.</p></div></li><li class="flex space-x-2.5 w-full"><span>121.</span><div class="text-left article-paragraph pr-2"><p>Cao, J.; Liang, X.; Ruamruk, S.; et al. Evaporation Cold Energy Storage and Thermoelectric Harvesting via Hydrogel-Phase Change Material-Thermoelectric Generator Tandem Structure.<em> Small Struct. </em><strong>2026</strong>,<em> 7</em>, e202500635. https://doi.org/10.1002/sstr.202500635.</p></div></li><li class="flex space-x-2.5 w-full"><span>122.</span><div class="text-left article-paragraph pr-2"><p>Cheng, S.; Tao, C.; Li, H. Preparation of Carbon Nanotubes from Organic Solid Wastes: A Review.<em> J. Anal. Appl. Pyrolysis </em><strong>2025</strong>,<em> 192</em>, 107240. https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jaap.2025.107240.</p></div></li><li class="flex space-x-2.5 w-full"><span>123.</span><div class="text-left article-paragraph pr-2"><p>Zhang, Y.; Wang, J.; Yang, X.; et al. Fabrication of Shape-Stabilized Phase Change Materials Based on Waste Plastics for Energy Storage.<em> J. Energy Storage </em><strong>2022</strong>,<em> 52</em>, 104973. https://doi.org/10.1016/j.est.2022.104973.</p></div></li><li class="flex space-x-2.5 w-full"><span>124.</span><div class="text-left article-paragraph pr-2"><p>Teggar, M.; Ajarostaghi, S.S.M.; Yıldız, Ç.; et al. Performance Enhancement of Latent Heat Storage Systems by Using Extended Surfaces and Porous Materials: A State-of-the-Art Review.<em> J. Energy Storage </em><strong>2021</strong>,<em> 44</em>, 103340. https://doi.org/10.1016/j.est.2021.103340.</p></div></li><li class="flex space-x-2.5 w-full"><span>125.</span><div class="text-left article-paragraph pr-2"><p>Xiong, Y.; Zhang, A.; Zhao, Y.; et al. A Mini Review on Sewage Sludge and Red Mud Recycling for Thermal Energy Storage.<em> Energies </em><strong>2024</strong>,<em> 17</em>, 2079. https://doi.org/10.3390/en17092079.</p></div></li><li class="flex space-x-2.5 w-full"><span>126.</span><div class="text-left article-paragraph pr-2"><p>Tian, Y.; Yang, R.; Pan, H.; et al. Biomass-Based Shape-Stabilized Phase Change Materials for Thermal Energy Storage and Multiple Energy Conversion.<em> Nano Energy </em><strong>2025</strong>,<em> 133</em>, 110440. https://doi.org/10.1016/j.nanoen.2024.110440.</p></div></li><li class="flex space-x-2.5 w-full"><span>127.</span><div class="text-left article-paragraph pr-2"><p>Jiang, J.; Cao, Y.; Li, G.; et al. Using Industrial Mining Solid Waste through Conversion to Phase-Change Materials for Thermal Energy Storage.<em> ChemPlusChem </em><strong>2025</strong>,<em> 90</em>, e202400519. https://doi.org/10.1002/cplu.202400519.</p></div></li><!--]--></ul><!--]--></div></div><!--[--><div class="el-scrollbar__bar is-horizontal" style="display:none;"><div class="el-scrollbar__thumb" style="width:;transform:translateX(0%);"></div></div><div class="el-scrollbar__bar is-vertical" style="display:none;"><div class="el-scrollbar__thumb" style="height:;transform:translateY